            http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/D000098409
        </a></dd>

        
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>A class of machine learning approaches that allow a system to discover the representations required for feature detection or classification from raw data. The requirement for manual feature engineering is reduced by allowing a machine to learn the features and apply them to a given activity.</dd>
                </span>
            
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Representation Learning, Machine
                    
                </dd>
                <dt>Previous Indexing</dt>
                
                    <dd>Machine Learning (2016-2024)</dd>
                
            <dt>Public MeSH Note</dt><dd>2025</dd>
        
            <dt>History Note</dt><dd>2025</dd>
        
        


        
                <dt>Date Introduced</dt>
                <dd>2025/01/01</dd>
            
                <dt>Last Updated</dt>
                <dd>2025/01/01</dd>
            

